+    active rows, so derive the uniform length from the positive entries rather
+    than assuming row zero is active. Full CUDA graphs also pad the token tensor
+    to the captured request bucket: in that layout ``num_decode_tokens`` counts
+    a query slot for every request row, including rows whose request offset has
